# Never commit a vault, a key, or an environment file. The preflight audit
# (scripts/preflight-public.mjs) is the backstop, not the first line of defence —
# and it only runs in CI, which cannot save you before `git add -A`.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*
*.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
